# EPIC-038 M2: shared .dockerignore for all container/ Dockerfiles
#
# Exclude everything from the build context by default, then allowlist
# exactly what each image needs. This keeps build contexts minimal and
# prevents source code, secrets, or model files from leaking into layers.

# Exclude everything
**

# Allow: nothing from the root context by default.
# Each Dockerfile uses ARG-based COPY or multi-stage FROM scratch patterns
# that do not rely on the build context beyond this file.
#
# Exception: Dockerfile.claude-sandbox uses COPY "${CLAUDE_BIN_PATH}" which
# is an absolute host path resolved at build time — the build context is unused
# for the binary itself. The ADD context exclusion above still applies.
